WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:18.988
The Metro City Art Gallery was very crowded.

2
00:00:18.989 --> 00:00:22.000
People were excited to see the new paintings.

3
00:00:22.001 --> 00:00:25.886
"These paintings are beautiful," said a woman.

4
00:00:25.887 --> 00:00:31.050
Her husband nodded. "Yes, they are very—

5
00:00:31.051 --> 00:00:34.421
Hey! What's going on here?"

6
00:00:34.422 --> 00:00:37.691
A thick fog slowly filled the room.

7
00:00:37.692 --> 00:00:42.519
"I can't see anything!" shouted a voice.

8
00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:45.735
When the fog cleared, a woman gasped.

9
00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:50.684
"Oh no! The paintings are gone!"

10
00:00:50.685 --> 00:00:53.665
"Watch this!" shouted Jack.

11
00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:57.130
He ran across Terrell's backyard as fast as he could.

12
00:00:57.131 --> 00:01:02.987
He jumped—ka-boosh!—and landed in the big pile of leaves.

13
00:01:02.988 --> 00:01:04.652
They flew everywhere.

14
00:01:04.653 --> 00:01:07.293
"Ha-ha!" Roxy laughed.

15
00:01:07.294 --> 00:01:12.073
"It's my turn!" said Mara.

16
00:01:12.074 --> 00:01:17.116
Everyone grabbed a rake.

17
00:01:17.117 --> 00:01:21.056
They all started raking leaves back into a huge pile.

18
00:01:21.057 --> 00:01:23.954
Soon it was ready for Mara to jump in.

19
00:01:23.955 --> 00:01:29.345
She walked to the other end of the backyard.

20
00:01:29.346 --> 00:01:33.234
Then she ran toward the leaves and jumped!

21
00:01:33.235 --> 00:01:36.783
"Woo-hoo!" yelled Mara.

22
00:01:36.784 --> 00:01:38.849
"This is so much fun,"

23
00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:41.410
said Terrell as he picked up his rake.

24
00:01:41.411 --> 00:01:46.408
"Yeah," said Roxy. "Fall is my favorite season.

25
00:01:46.409 --> 00:01:48.084
I love the cool air.

26
00:01:48.085 --> 00:01:52.131
And I love playing in the leaves."

27
00:01:52.132 --> 00:01:56.044
"My favorite season is winter," said Terrell.

28
00:01:56.045 --> 00:01:58.680
"I love playing in the snow."

29
00:01:58.681 --> 00:02:02.290
"I can't wait for it to start snowing," said Jack.

30
00:02:02.291 --> 00:02:05.139
"I wish it would snow now!"

31
00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:08.526
"It's still too warm for snow," said Roxy.

32
00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:12.096
"I don't think it will snow for a few more months."

33
00:02:12.097 --> 00:02:16.817
"You're probably right," said Jack with a sigh.

34
00:02:16.818 --> 00:02:20.119
The friends finished raking the leaves back into a pile.

35
00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:25.704
Then it was Roxy's turn.

36
00:02:25.705 --> 00:02:30.195
"Whee!" Roxy shouted as she jumped into the pile.

37
00:02:30.196 --> 00:02:34.568
As the friends raked the leaves again, Terrell had an idea.

38
00:02:34.569 --> 00:02:38.502
"We should ask Rocket Girl to make it snow!" he said.

39
00:02:38.503 --> 00:02:42.013
"That's a ridiculous idea," said Roxy.

40
00:02:42.014 --> 00:02:46.098
"Rocket Girl has no control over the weather."

41
00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:50.710
"But she has super powers!" said Terrell.

42
00:02:50.711 --> 00:02:54.219
Before Roxy could respond, her watch beeped.

43
00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:56.289
"Uh-oh," she thought.

44
00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:58.314
She looked at her friends.

45
00:02:58.315 --> 00:03:00.648
"Sorry, guys," she said.

46
00:03:00.649 --> 00:03:04.407
"But I just remembered I told my mom I'd be home for lunch.

47
00:03:04.408 --> 00:03:08.700
I'll be back later."

48
00:03:08.701 --> 00:03:16.012
As soon as Roxy was in front of Terrell's house, she answered the call.

49
00:03:16.013 --> 00:03:20.286
"Mayor Bloom," she said. "What's going on?"

50
00:03:20.287 --> 00:03:23.719
"We have a problem, Rocket Girl," said Mayor Bloom.

51
00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.785
"There's been a robbery.

52
00:03:25.786 --> 00:03:30.695
All the new paintings at the Metro City Art Gallery have been stolen!"

53
00:03:30.696 --> 00:03:33.455
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

54
00:03:33.456 --> 00:03:39.326
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"
